    "identifier": "hiyaTaihou",
    "description": "<p>Exotic ranged weapon. 3d6 Fire. Range (60/150), Two-Handed, Ammunition, Volatile 4, Special. Group: Ammunition.</p>\n<p>When you declare an attack with the Hiya Taihou, roll a d20. If the result equals or is less than the weapon's Volatile rank, the weapon backfires before the attack resolves and follows the normal Volatile rules. If the result exceeds the Volatile rank, the attack proceeds.</p>\n<p>The Hiya Taihou cannot target a specific creature. Instead, select a point you can see within range. All creatures within a 5-foot radius centered on that point must make a Dexterity saving throw vs a DC of 8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Dexterity Modifier. On a failure, creatures take the weapon's damage. On a success, they take damage as if the dice rolled the minimum possible value.</p>",
